# [OAUTH](../wg/oauth.html)

## Summary

The OAUTH Working Group held an interim virtual meeting on February 5, 2026. The main focus of the meeting was a presentation and discussion on the **AAuth (Agent Authorization / Authentication)** protocol proposal. The group debated whether AAuth should be developed as a new protocol (either within a new working group or as a major reboot of OAuth) or whether the core requirements of autonomous agents should be addressed incrementally by evolving the existing OAuth 2.0 framework.

